            "id": 82609,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Trova il numero più piccolo di condivisioni ottenute da un post sui social media negli ultimi quattro giorni con <code>min(shares)</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shares = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(min(shares))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"40\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>min(shares)</code>.</p></body></html>"
